    {
      "id": "act02",
      "name": "第 2 幕",
      "scene": "archive_vault",
      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "有人说《史记》是史书，也有人说它是文学，你们怎么看？",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act03",
      "name": "第 3 幕",
      "scene": "palace_hall",
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "我写的时候只想让人记住人，不是记住年份。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act04",
      "name": "第 4 幕",
      "scene": "temple_court",
      "camera": "dolly",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_b",
      "text": "读《史记》像照镜子，照见的是我们自己的软肋。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_b",
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act05",
      "name": "第 5 幕",
      "scene": "archive_vault",
      "camera": "static",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "所以它两千年后还在被翻烂。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act06",
      "name": "第 6 幕",
      "scene": "palace_hall",
      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "那你们写人物的时候，会不会故意留下疑点？",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act07",
      "name": "第 7 幕",
      "scene": "temple_court",
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "会。史书写不满的地方，正是后人反复读的地方。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act08",
      "name": "第 8 幕",
      "scene": "archive_vault",
      "camera": "dolly",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_b",
      "text": "所以读《史记》像破案，越读越觉得人心难写。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_b",
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
